cleared staff.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"The group's credentialing team of five was processing more than 400 files left over from a surge in travel nurse placements. Turnaround times stretched beyond 23 days, and account managers were fielding weekly escalations from hospital clients waiting on cleared staff."}],["$","p","Licence expirations were slipping through manual spreadsheet tracking, creating audit exposure and forcing last-minute scrambling before compliance reviews. Overtime among the in-house team had run for eleven consecutive weeks, and burnout was driving attrition.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Licence expirations were slipping through manual spreadsheet tracking, creating audit exposure and forcing last-minute scrambling before compliance reviews. Overtime among the in-house team had run for eleven consecutive weeks, and burnout was driving attrition."}],["$","p","Invoice reconciliation was equally fragile: hours worked and facility confirmations were matched by hand, delaying billing runs and pushing days sales outstanding well beyond the group's 45-day target. The back office had become the bottleneck on growth.",{"className":"font-body-md text-body-md text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Invoice reconciliation was equally fragile: hours worked and facility confirmations were matched by hand, delaying billing runs and pushing days sales outstanding well beyond the group's 45-day target. The back office had become the bottleneck on growth."}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"w-full py-space-3xl bg-slate-surface","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin lg:px-margin-desktop space-y-space-2xl","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-2xl space-y-space-sm","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-emerald-accent tracking-widest uppercase font-bold","children":"THE APPROACH"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-forest-deep font-bold","children":"How the Pod Was Deployed."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-space-lg","children":[["$","div","Rapid Diagnostic",{"className":"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xl rounded-xl shadow-sm space-y-space-md","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-display-hero text-[32px] font-extrabold text-emerald-accent/40","children":"01"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-slate-text-main font-bold","children":"Rapid Diagnostic"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"A two-week diagnostic mapped the credentialing lifecycle from application receipt to facility clearance, quantifying touchpoints, wait states, and rework. Every step was scored for automation potential and compliance sensitivity before any work moved offshore."}]]}],["$","div","Workflow Rebuild",{"className":"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xl rounded-xl shadow-sm space-y-space-md","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-display-hero text-[32px] font-extrabold text-emerald-accent/40","children":"02"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-slate-text-main font-bold","children":"Workflow Rebuild"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-text-muted leading-relaxed","children":"The credentialing and reconciliation processes were rebuilt as documented standard operating procedures with mandatory checkpoints and expiry alerts. A secure queue replaced the shared spreadsheet, giving every file a single owner and a visible ageing status."}]]}],["$","div","Shadow & Transfer",{"className":"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-xl rounded-xl shadow-sm space-y-space-md","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-display-hero text-[32px] f